@@ -0,0 +1,10 @@
+---
+features:
+  - |
+    Added ``openstack_logging_json``, which switches every oslo.log based
+    OpenStack service to structured JSON logging. Fluentd parses either
+    format, and JSON keeps fields such as the request context structured
+    rather than packed into the message text. It defaults to ``False``, so
+    existing deployments are unaffected. This is a single switch for all
+    oslo.log services because they share one Fluentd input, and a mix of
+    formats in that input cannot be parsed.
